%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize': '14px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Player as 玩家
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SG as ScenarioGenerator
    participant MC as MemoryController
    participant Exam as Examiner
    participant Dir as Director
    participant LLM as LLMClient
    participant GS as GameStateManager
    participant DB as SQLite+FAISS

    Player->>FE: 输入行动
    FE->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/generate

    API->>SG: generate()

    Note over SG,DB: ① 加载状态 + ② RAG检索
    SG->>DB: 加载session state + FAISS向量检索
    DB-->>SG: state + RAG结果

    Note over SG,MC: ③ 记忆上下文组装
    SG->>MC: assemble_context()
    MC-->>SG: L0全量 + L1 Top-5 + L2匹配

    Note over SG,LLM: ④⑤ Prompt构建 + Agent管线
    SG->>Exam: examine() → verdict
    SG->>Dir: direct() → narrative_direction
    SG->>LLM: generate(prompt, T=0.35)
    LLM-->>SG: StoryOutput

    Note over SG,GS: ⑥ 状态应用
    SG->>GS: apply_output(memory_updates)
    GS-->>SG: updated_state

    Note over SG,DB: ⑦ 持久化（两阶段） + ⑧ 异步记忆维护
    SG->>DB: INSERT messages + UPDATE state + INSERT model_output
    SG->>MC: on_turn_generated() [Fire-and-Forget]
    MC->>MC: NSB/PCB/SCORE/Forgetting → DB

    Note over SG: ⑨ 每5轮: Fact Extraction → DB

    SG-->>API: GenerateResponse
    API-->>FE: JSON
    FE-->>Player: 叙事 + 选项 + 状态
